              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ഉൾക്കൊണ്ടു, uḷkkoṇṭu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also to accept an idea: ആ ആശയം അവൻ ഉൾക്കൊണ്ടു, he took that idea to heart."
